## 4. Verification Plan

### Automated / Browser Verification
1. Initialize Vite React project and verify clean build with `npm run build`.
2. Launch dev server on `http://localhost:5173`.
3. Use `browser_subagent` to navigate through every screen:
   - Login page (`/`)
   - Command Center (`/command-center`)
   - Live Map (`/live-map`) and trigger Incident Verification
   - Incidents table (`/incidents`), trigger filters and empty state
   - Teams page (`/teams`), trigger assignment
   - Communication page (`/communication`), post message and send broadcast
   - Reports page (`/reports`), check charts and PDF export trigger
4. Capture high-resolution screenshots of each view and compare side-by-side with the reference PNGs in `./design`.

---

